cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the paper it
  implements.
type: software
title: einstein-tiling
abstract: >-
  Generate aperiodic tilings by the hat monotile as SVG images, using the
  clusters and matching rules of Smith, Myers, Kaplan and Goodman-Strauss.
authors:
  - given-names: Christian
    family-names: Hill
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/xnx/einstein-tiling"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/einstein-tiling/"
keywords:
  - aperiodic tiling
  - einstein
  - hat
  - monotile
